WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:04.895
WE COULD GO ON, BUT IT'S

00:00:03.827 --> 00:00:05.896
DISGUSTING.

00:00:05.028 --> 00:00:06.697
HE GOES TO PRISON FOR NINE

00:00:06.029 --> 00:00:08.699
MONTHS.

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:10.300
IT'S A GOOD THING HE DIDN'T

00:00:08.832 --> 00:00:12.302
QUESTION DIVERSELY BECAUSE THEN

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:13.570
HE'D BE IN REAL TROUBLE.

00:00:12.436 --> 00:00:15.706
WE HAVE TOLD YOU ON THE SHOW A

00:00:13.704 --> 00:00:19.342
COUPLE OF TIMES ABOUT DECLINING

00:00:15.839 --> 00:00:20.510
STANDARDS AT THE FAA, PLIGHT OF

00:00:19.476 --> 00:00:21.712
PART OF THE WIDER WAR ON

00:00:20.644 --> 00:00:23.914
STANDARDS.

00:00:21.845 --> 00:00:26.083
IN THE NAME OF DIVERSITY, THE

00:00:24.047 --> 00:00:28.051
FAA HAS ADDED AN IRRELEVANT

00:00:26.349 --> 00:00:30.687
BIOGRAPHICAL SECTION TO ITS

00:00:28.185 --> 00:00:32.089
HIRING PROCESS FOR AIR-TRAFFIC

00:00:30.821 --> 00:00:33.890
CONTROLLERS.

00:00:32.322 --> 00:00:35.892
CONGRESS COULD INTERVENE AND

00:00:34.024 --> 00:00:36.993
DICTATE THAT HIRING BE SOLELY

00:00:36.026 --> 00:00:40.464
BASED ON QUALIFICATIONS.

00:00:37.127 --> 00:00:47.771
WE HOPE THAT HAPPENS AND SO DOES

00:00:40.597 --> 00:00:52.509
CHAIRMAN FRANK KOLBE ANDO.

00:00:47.904 --> 00:00:53.477
SO AS YOU ALREADY KNOW, THE FAA

00:00:52.642 --> 00:00:54.911
INTENTIONALLY SEEKS OUT

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:55.579
UNQUALIFIED AIR TRAFFIC

00:00:55.045 --> 00:00:56.113
CONTROLLERS WHICH IS WHOLE

00:00:55.712 --> 00:00:57.681
HORRIFYING.

00:00:56.246 --> 00:01:00.484
WHAT WE HAVEN'T BEEN ABLE TO

00:00:57.814 --> 00:01:01.151
FIGURE OUT IS WHO IS RESPONSIBLE

00:01:00.617 --> 00:01:02.853
FOR THIS?

00:01:01.284 --> 00:01:03.253
&gt;&gt; FIRST, THANK YOU FOR RAISING

00:01:02.986 --> 00:01:04.454
THIS AGAIN.

00:01:03.386 --> 00:01:05.922
IT WAS YOUR NETWORK WHO FIRST

00:01:04.588 --> 00:01:08.558
RAISED IT A COUPLE OF YEARS AGO

00:01:06.056 --> 00:01:11.094
AND GAVE US THE ABILITY TO GET

00:01:08.692 --> 00:01:13.096
SOME TRACTION, BUT UNFORTUNATELY

00:01:11.228 --> 00:01:14.498
UNFORTUNATELY IT GOT SHOT IN THE

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:15.899
DOOR.

00:01:14.631 --> 00:01:16.900
WE WERE BLINDSIDED.

00:01:16.032 --> 00:01:19.569
UNDER THE OBAMA ADMINISTRATION

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:20.704
AND THE FAA ADMINISTRATOR AT THE

00:01:19.703 --> 00:01:21.972
TIME, MICHAEL WIRT, NORMALLY

00:01:20.837 --> 00:01:24.374
THEY COME TO CONGRESS AND SAY,

00:01:22.105 --> 00:01:25.342
WE ARE GOING TO CHANGE THE

00:01:24.508 --> 00:01:27.577
PROCEDURES.

00:01:25.475 --> 00:01:28.478
IN THIS PARTICULAR CASE,

00:01:27.711 --> 00:01:29.780
AIR-TRAFFIC CONTROLLER

00:01:29.513 --> 00:01:31.915
QUALIFYING.

00:01:29.913 --> 00:01:33.517
WHAT ARE WE GOING TO DO?

00:01:32.048 --> 00:01:34.484
NOTHING, JUST DID IT AND

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:36.319
BLINDSIDED US.

00:01:34.618 --> 00:01:37.888
WE STARTED ASKING QUESTIONS, WHY

00:01:36.453 --> 00:01:38.622
DID YOU DO IT?

00:01:38.021 --> 00:01:41.158
DID YOU CHECK THIS BIOGRAPHICAL

00:01:38.755 --> 00:01:42.726
APP TO MAKE SURE IT WAS GOING TO

00:01:41.291 --> 00:01:43.326
WORK?

00:01:42.859 --> 00:01:45.128
NOTHING, SILENCE.

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:46.596
WE'VE BEEN FIGHTING THIS FOR A

00:01:45.262 --> 00:01:47.697
COUPLE OF YEARS, WITHOUT GETTING

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:50.734
ANY ANSWERS AND ANY EXPLANATION

00:01:47.831 --> 00:02:01.178
AS TO WHY COME UP WITH A TOTAL

00:01:50.867 --> 00:02:01.178
BLINDSIDE.

00:02:11.688 --> 00:02:12.889
WE HAD THE DEPARTMENT OF

00:02:12.289 --> 00:02:13.256
TRANSPORTATION INSPECTOR GENERAL

00:02:13.023 --> 00:02:13.824
INVOLVED.

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:14.558
WE HAVE THE GOVERNMENT

00:02:13.957 --> 00:02:15.292
ACCOUNTING OFFICE INVOLVED, AND

00:02:14.691 --> 00:02:16.026
IT YOU HAD A VERY ABLE GUEST ON,

00:02:15.425 --> 00:02:16.393
MICHAEL PEARSON, WHO HAS DONE A

00:02:16.159 --> 00:02:17.127
GREAT JOB.

00:02:16.526 --> 00:02:17.794
BUT BECAUSE OF THE LAWSUIT, BOTH

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:18.495
OF THESE AGENCIES SHUT DOWN.

00:02:17.928 --> 00:02:18.929
SO WHAT WAS THE MOST EGREGIOUS

00:02:18.628 --> 00:02:19.629
PART OF THIS?

00:02:19.062 --> 00:02:20.330
WE HAVE ALREADY ATTEMPTED AND

00:02:19.763 --> 00:02:20.697
ADDRESSED, AND THAT IS THE CTI

00:02:20.463 --> 00:02:23.133
STUDENTS.

00:02:20.831 --> 00:02:23.834
THAT'S HOW IT FIRST CAME TO ME.

00:02:23.266 --> 00:02:25.735
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THEY INTENTIONALLY

00:02:23.967 --> 00:02:26.136
GO TO SCHOOL TO BE AIR-TRAFFIC

00:02:25.869 --> 00:02:28.939
CONTROLLERS.

00:02:26.269 --> 00:02:30.774
&gt;&gt; THEY HAVE THE APTITUDE AND

00:02:29.072 --> 00:02:31.374
PAY TENS OF THOUSANDS TO DO

00:02:30.907 --> 00:02:32.676
THIS.

00:02:31.508 --> 00:02:34.811
IT'S AMAZING, AND THEY HAVE THE

00:02:32.809 --> 00:02:36.813
RUG PULLED OUT FROM UNDER THEM.

00:02:34.945 --> 00:02:39.282
THEY WERE TOTALLY QUALIFIED AND

00:02:36.947 --> 00:02:48.091
TOLD HER, SORRY.

00:02:39.416 --> 00:02:49.593
&gt;&gt; SO IS THERE ANYONE ELSE THAT

00:02:48.225 --> 00:02:50.927
SHOULD THAT DEFENDS IT?

00:02:49.726 --> 00:02:52.729
&gt;&gt; I DOUBT IT.

00:02:51.061 --> 00:02:53.330
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO WHY SHOULDN'T

00:02:52.863 --> 00:02:54.030
CONGRESS PASSED IN ITS

00:02:53.463 --> 00:02:57.934
AUTHORIZATION FOR FUNDING FOR

00:02:54.164 --> 00:03:00.303
THE FAA A RULE THAT SAYS YOU

00:02:58.068 --> 00:03:01.304
CANNOT USE IRRELEVANT CRITERIA

00:03:00.437 --> 00:03:01.705
FOR HIRING AIR-TRAFFIC

00:03:01.438 --> 00:03:03.173
CONTROLLERS?

00:03:01.838 --> 00:03:04.107
IT'S TOO IMPORTANT.

00:03:03.306 --> 00:03:05.709
COULD WE DO THAT?

00:03:04.241 --> 00:03:07.277
&gt;&gt; IF I WERE WRITING A BILL AND

00:03:05.842 --> 00:03:08.178
WERE ABLE TO DO IT WITHOUT THE

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:11.481
CONSENT OF OUR SENATE AND ABLE

00:03:08.311 --> 00:03:12.682
TO DO IT THROUGH OUR COMMITTEE,

00:03:11.615 --> 00:03:13.717
I WOULD DO IT.

00:03:12.816 --> 00:03:15.919
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NEED TO HIRE

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:16.253
UNEMPLOYED PEOPLE WHO ARE BAD AT

00:03:16.052 --> 00:03:17.954
SCIENCE.

00:03:16.386 --> 00:03:21.892
&gt;&gt; THEY WON'T PUT IT THAT WAY,

00:03:18.088 --> 00:03:25.161
BUT YOU KNOW THE WAY IT WORKS.

00:03:22.025 --> 00:03:27.731
IT HAS TO GO TO CONFERENCE AND

00:03:25.295 --> 00:03:28.298
THE SENATE GETS INVOLVED AND IT

00:03:27.864 --> 00:03:30.500
GETS MOCKED UP.

00:03:28.431 --> 00:03:33.336
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DO YOU THINK THEY

00:03:30.634 --> 00:03:34.104
UNDERSTAND -- THESE ARE

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.872
AIR-TRAFFIC CONTROLLERS.

00:03:34.237 --> 00:03:36.373
&gt;&gt; PEOPLE AREN'T PAYING

00:03:36.006 --> 00:03:38.275
ATTENTION TO IT.

00:03:36.506 --> 00:03:40.343
BUT WHAT WE WERE ABLE TO POINT

00:03:38.408 --> 00:03:44.180
OUT IS THAT THE CTI STUDENTS,

00:03:40.477 --> 00:03:45.148
AND MAY BE MOST EGREGIOUSLY,

00:03:44.314 --> 00:03:46.349
MILITARY, A FORMER MILITARY,

00:03:45.282 --> 00:03:49.452
ESPECIALLY MILITARY AIR TRAFFIC

00:03:46.483 --> 00:03:49.786
CONTROLLERS ARE NOW INTO THE MIX

00:03:49.619 --> 00:03:50.487
AGAIN.

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:52.289
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT'S GOOD TO COME

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:53.089
UP BUT IF THERE IS A SINGLE

00:03:52.422 --> 00:03:55.325
PERSON WHO IS UNQUALIFIED AND

00:03:53.223 --> 00:03:59.195
HIRED FOR THIS JOB AGAIN, THIS

00:03:55.458 --> 00:04:01.831
IS NOT TO BECOME A GYM TEACHER.

00:03:59.329 --> 00:04:02.232
THESE ARE AIR-TRAFFIC

00:04:01.965 --> 00:04:03.133
CONTROLLERS.

00:04:02.365 --> 00:04:03.934
&gt;&gt; AND THIS IS ALSO IMPORTANT TO

00:04:03.266 --> 00:04:05.335
KNOW.

00:04:04.067 --> 00:04:07.170
IF ONE OF THESE PEOPLE WHO MAYBE

00:04:05.468 --> 00:04:08.838
DOESN'T BELONG THERE GETS

00:04:07.304 --> 00:04:11.708
THROUGH THE INITIAL PROCESS,

00:04:08.972 --> 00:04:13.143
THEY HAVE TO GO THROUGH THE

00:04:11.841 --> 00:04:17.480
ACADEMY, AND THEY ARE WASHED OUT

00:04:13.276 --> 00:04:19.716
BECAUSE THE ACADEMY PUTS UP WITH

00:04:17.614 --> 00:04:22.719
NO NONSENSE.

00:04:19.849 --> 00:04:24.087
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THERE ARE MORE

00:04:22.852 --> 00:04:24.921
THINGS THAT ARE IMPORTANT FOR

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:27.991
BUREAUCRACY.

00:04:25.055 --> 00:04:34.064
AND YOU ARE GRADED ON IRRELEVANT

00:04:28.124 --> 00:04:35.498
CRITERIA, AND SO, IT'S WRONG.

